    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Germs are too tiny to see. Lots of them stick to the natural oils on our skin.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🦠",
        "text": "Tiny germs",
        "cue": "germs",
        "sub": "Stuck in skin oils",
        "sub_cue": "oils"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Can't water just wash them off?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Water alone isn't great at it, because oil and water don't mix. The germs just slide around.",
      "punch": "mix",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "💧",
        "text": "Oil and water don't mix",
        "cue": "mix"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So what does soap do?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Soap is made of tiny bits with two ends. One end loves water. The other end loves oil and grabs on tight!",
      "punch": "grabs",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "One end",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Loves water",
              "icon": "💧",
              "cue": "water"
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "Other end",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Loves oil",
              "icon": "🫒",
              "cue": "oil"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Like a tiny tug of war?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Kind of! The soap bits grab the oil and germs and wrap them up in tiny bubbles. Soap can even break some germs apart.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Soap at work",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Grab the oil",
            "icon": "🧲",
            "cue": "grab"
          },
          {
            "label": "Wrap up the germs",
            "icon": "🫧",
            "cue": "wrap"
          },
          {
            "label": "Break some germs apart",
            "icon": "💥",
            "cue": "break"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then what?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Then the water rinses the bubbles away, germs and all!",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🚿",
        "text": "Rinse them away!",
        "cue": "rinses"
